  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Y2K-inspired metallic upper\nLow-top sneaker silhouette\nPadded collar provides additional relief\nMax Air unit in the heel offers cushioned comfort that lasts\nStitched overlays and TPU detailing for added durability that nods to the '90s\nTraction rubber waffle outsole delivers heritage looks and reliable traction across surfaces\nThe Nike Air Max 90 SP is imported.\n\nChromecore makes a comeback with these early 2000s-inspired Women's Nike Air Max 90 SP Casual Shoes. Crafted with a lustrous metallic upper, these low-pro sneakers feature the visible Air unit you know and love, along with '90s design cues that stay true to the OG AM90—a fresh spin on a forever classic.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max 90 SP Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Rose Gold/Rose Gold/Metallic Red Bronze</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3340584</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 6